       <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="targetEdgeLengthSpinBox">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Edge length the surface triangles aim for. It also sets the thickness of the boundary layer and, through it, the size of the tetrahedra, so it is the one number that says how fine the whole mesh comes out.</string>
